UnitCLFactory::SetPoolSwapHook
├── when caller isn't swap fee manager
│   └── it reverts with NotSwapFeeManager
└── when caller is swap fee manager
    ├── when pools and swap hooks lengths mismatch
    │   └── it reverts with LMM
    └── when pools and swap hooks lengths match
        ├── it sets each pool poolSwapHook to its swap hook
        └── it emits PoolSwapHookChanged per pool
